  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "30630001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真是抱歉，今天社区的手办治安又麻烦你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "没关系，风纪委员本来就是黑子的本职工作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "而且我知道，你把治安工作托付给我，是为了让我尽快适应这里，谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "扑通——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "黑子，你怎么了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "没事，只是因为使用了太多次能力所以有点疲劳而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "对不起，都是我让你涉险才会……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你背后的涂料好像也有点刮掉了，我帮你重新上一次吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "等、等一下，你把我拿起来干什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为要拿近一点才不会涂歪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "不用了，我自己来就好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30630012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "白井黑子",
          "text": "请你放开，我没有那种癖好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
